{
  "title": "Révisions anglais-droit : consonnes et voyelles",
  "td": "Révisions ET",
  "intro": "Programme de l'examen : séances 1 à 3 (transcription, consonnes, voyelles). Norme : SSBE. Tous les mots sont <b>nouveaux</b>, et la plupart viennent du vocabulaire juridique. Pour vérifier une prononciation : <a href=\"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Cambridge Dictionary</a>, audio UK.",
  "credits": [
    {
      "file": "En-uk-tort.ogg",
      "author": "auteur non indiqué",
      "license": "domaine public"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "1. Décrire une consonne",
      "instructions": "Quel son notent les lettres en gras ? Rappel : phonation, lieu, mode.",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\"><b>th</b>eft</span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ð/</span> voiced dental fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/θ/</span> voiceless dental fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/t/</span> voiceless alveolar stop",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/f/</span> voiceless labiodental fricative"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "feedback": "<i>theft</i> <span class=\"ipa\">/θeft/</span>."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\">collu<b>s</b>ion</span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/s/</span> voiceless alveolar fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/z/</span> voiced alveolar fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ʃ/</span> voiceless postalveolar fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ʒ/</span> voiced postalveolar fricative"
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "feedback": "<i>collusion</i> <span class=\"ipa\">/kəˈluːʒn̩/</span>, comme <i>decision</i> ou <i>conclusion</i>."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\">bindi<b>ng</b></span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/n/</span> alveolar nasal",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ŋ/</span> velar nasal",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ŋɡ/</span> velar nasal + voiced velar stop",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ɡ/</span> voiced velar stop"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "feedback": "<span class=\"ipa\">/ˈbaɪndɪŋ/</span> : ‹ng› final note un seul son, la nasale vélaire, sans /ɡ/ après."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\"><b>ch</b>arge</span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ʃ/</span> voiceless postalveolar fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/tʃ/</span> voiceless postalveolar affricate",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/k/</span> voiceless velar stop",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/dʒ/</span> voiced postalveolar affricate"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "feedback": "<i>charge</i> <span class=\"ipa\">/tʃɑːdʒ/</span> commence par une affriquée, pas par le <i>ch</i> français de <i>charger</i>."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\">char<b>ge</b></span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ʒ/</span> voiced postalveolar fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ɡ/</span> voiced velar stop",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/dʒ/</span> voiced postalveolar affricate",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/tʃ/</span> voiceless postalveolar affricate"
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "feedback": "Le ‹ge› final de <i>charge</i> note l'affriquée voisée <span class=\"ipa\">/dʒ/</span>."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\"><b>v</b>oid</span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/v/</span> voiced labiodental fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/f/</span> voiceless labiodental fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/b/</span> voiced bilabial stop",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/w/</span> approximant"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "feedback": "<i>void</i> <span class=\"ipa\">/vɔɪd/</span>."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\"><b>y</b>ield</span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/dʒ/</span> voiced postalveolar affricate",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/j/</span> palatal approximant",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/i/</span> close front vowel",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ʒ/</span> voiced postalveolar fricative"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "feedback": "<i>yield</i> <span class=\"ipa\">/jiːld/</span>. Le symbole <span class=\"ipa\">/j/</span> note le son de <i>yes</i>, pas celui de <i>jour</i>."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\"><b>l</b>iable</span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/r/</span> approximant",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/l/</span> alveolar lateral approximant",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/n/</span> alveolar nasal",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/j/</span> palatal approximant"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "feedback": "<i>liable</i> <span class=\"ipa\">/ˈlaɪəbl̩/</span> : l'air sort par les côtés de la langue, d'où « latérale »."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"big\"><b>h</b>eir</span>",
          "options": [
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/h/</span> voiceless glottal fricative",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/x/</span> voiceless velar fricative",
            "aucun son : le ‹h› est muet",
            "<span class=\"ipa\">/ʔ/</span> glottal stop"
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "feedback": "<i>heir</i> <span class=\"ipa\">/eə/</span> se prononce exactement comme <i>air</i>. Même chose dans <i>heiress</i>, <i>honest</i>, <i>hour</i>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Trouvez l'intrus",
      "instructions": "Un son ne partage pas une propriété commune aux autres.",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"ipa big\">/p t k b/</span>",
          "options": [
            "/p/",
            "/t/",
            "/k/",
            "/b/"
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "feedback": "/b/ est la seule voisée : les autres sont des occlusives sourdes."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"ipa big\">/m n ŋ l/</span>",
          "options": [
            "/m/",
            "/n/",
            "/ŋ/",
            "/l/"
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "feedback": "/l/ est une latérale ; les autres sont des nasales."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"ipa big\">/s z t ʃ n/</span>",
          "options": [
            "/s/",
            "/z/",
            "/t/",
            "/ʃ/",
            "/n/"
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "feedback": "/ʃ/ est postalvéolaire ; les autres sont alvéolaires."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"ipa big\">/θ ð f v d/</span>",
          "options": [
            "/θ/",
            "/ð/",
            "/f/",
            "/v/",
            "/d/"
          ],
          "answer": 4,
          "feedback": "/d/ est une occlusive ; les autres sont des fricatives."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"ipa big\">/iː ɪ e æ ɒ/</span>",
          "options": [
            "/iː/",
            "/ɪ/",
            "/e/",
            "/æ/",
            "/ɒ/"
          ],
          "answer": 4,
          "feedback": "/ɒ/ est postérieure et arrondie ; les autres sont antérieures et non arrondies."
        },
        {
          "type": "qcm",
          "prompt": "<span class=\"ipa big\">/uː ʊ ɔː ɒ ʌ/</span>",
          "options": [
            "/uː/",
            "/ʊ/",
            "/ɔː/",
            "/ɒ/",
            "/ʌ/"
          ],
          "answer": 4,
          "feedback": "/ʌ/ est la seule non arrondie."
        }
      ]
    },
